### 1) Créer une agence
POST http://localhost:8080/api/agences
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "AutoLoc Tunis Centre",
  "ville": "Tunis",
  "adresse": "12 Avenue Habib Bourguiba",
  "telephone": "71123456"
}

### 2) Lister les agences
GET http://localhost:8080/api/agences

### 3) Créer un véhicule (l'agence 1 doit exister)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vehicules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "immatriculation": "123 TUN 4567",
  "marque": "Peugeot",
  "modele": "208",
  "categorie": "CITADINE",
  "tarifJournalier": 85.50,
  "agenceId": 1,
  "equipementIds": []
}

### 4) Lister les véhicules
GET http://localhost:8080/api/vehicules

### 5) Modifier le véhicule 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/vehicules/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "immatriculation": "123 TUN 4567",
  "marque": "Peugeot",
  "modele": "208 GT",
  "categorie": "CITADINE",
  "tarifJournalier": 95.00,
  "statut": "MAINTENANCE",
  "agenceId": 1,
  "equipementIds": []
}

### 6) Supprimer le véhicule 1
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/vehicules/1